When multiple elite traders independently build positions in the same cluster of related markets, the signal compounds beyond what single-market activity reveals. A [convergence signal](/what-is-a-convergence-signal/) in one Fed outcome market is interesting. The same traders simultaneously positioning across the entire Fed decision complex suggests deeper conviction and analysis.

